  "description": "The credit-limit boundary, exactly on it. ACCT-CREDIT-LIMIT is substituted for 504.77, which is precisely WS-TEMP-BAL, and the test at :407 is IF ACCT-CREDIT-LIMIT >= WS-TEMP-BAL - greater than OR EQUAL - so equality CONTINUEs and the transaction posts. Both operands are PIC S9(10)V99 and PIC S9(09)V99 respectively, so both are compared at scale 2 with no rounding anywhere: the keyword ROUNDED appears zero times in all twenty-eight programs, which is why every store in this migration truncates. This case, case11 and case12 are one cent apart and together they pin the comparison's direction, its inclusiveness and its scale; a mode that carried the excess into the last retained digit would move the boundary and one of the three would fail.",
